---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import Card from "../../components/Card.astro";
import { site } from "../../config/site";
---

<PageLayout title="Who We Are" intro={site.tagline}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 space-y-16">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-gray-500 uppercase">
          Who We Are at E3 CoE
        </p>

        <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold leading-tight">
          A National Authority Advancing Economic Growth That Lasts
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          E3 CoE is a Certified Economic Development Corporation built around the E³ CoE Model
          to align strategy, capital, and execution—delivering measurable, inclusive, and sustainable
          economic outcomes for communities nationwide.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a
            href="/"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[#5B9BD5] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:opacity-90 transition"
          >
            Explore Our Mission →
          </a>

          <a
            href="/membership/join"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-gray-300 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal hover:shadow-md transition"
          >
            Join the Movement
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-gray-500">
          Hero image/video suggestions: diverse skyline montage (urban + rural), leaders collaborating
          around dashboards, infrastructure/workforce/small business layered imagery, subtle motion
          video of economic activity.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <Card padding="sm">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] rounded-md bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-sm text-gray-500">
            Hero image / video placeholder
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600">
            Replace with your selected montage or motion video when ready.
          </p>
        </Card>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- The “Why” -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">The “Why” of E3 CoE</h2>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <Card padding="md">
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            Communities across the United States are under pressure to grow—yet too often
            lack the strategy, coordination, and execution capacity to turn funding and policy into real outcomes.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md">
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            Economic development for marginalized, underserved, and underrepresented communities has become complex,
            fragmented, and is not results-driven. Capital without clarity fails. Programs without accountability stall.
            Vision without execution fades.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-600 italic">
            We exist to change that; thus, our tagline is “Serving With Purpose.”
          </p>
        </Card>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Differentiated Value Proposition -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">
        The E3 CoE Community-Driven Differentiated Value Proposition
      </h2>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <Card padding="md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Certified governance &amp; compliance</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">
            Meets federal and philanthropic standards.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Growth Intelligence frameworks</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">
            Turn data into decisions that leaders can act on.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Integrated economic development model</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">
            Education, workforce development (UpSkilling &amp; ReSkilling), entrepreneurship, and regional competitiveness.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Execution-first leadership</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">
            Focused on outcomes—not optics.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md" class="lg:col-span-2">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Our results</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">
            Communities that move faster, partners that trust deeper, and investments that deliver.
          </p>
        </Card>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Validation / Trust Signals -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">
        Validation of the E3 CoE Business Case
      </h2>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <Card padding="md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Federally compliant governance</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">
            Policies aligned for accountability and audit readiness.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Board-led fiduciary oversight</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">
            Oversight designed to strengthen trust and stewardship.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Forecasting &amp; audit readiness</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">
            Multi-year financial forecasting and audit preparedness.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md" class="lg:col-span-2">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Funding alignment by design</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2">
            Built for federal, state, and philanthropic funding alignment.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Trust badges (visuals)</h3>
          <ul class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1">
            <li>• “Federally Compliant”</li>
            <li>• “Certified Economic Development Corporation”</li>
            <li>• Governance | Transparency | Accountability icons</li>
          </ul>
        </Card>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section>
      <Card padding="lg">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-6">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Ready to build outcomes that last?</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mt-2 max-w-2xl">
              Learn how E3 CoE is redefining economic development through strategy, capital alignment,
              and execution-focused leadership.
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">
              (You’ll provide the HubSpot link — this button is ready to be updated.)
            </p>
          </div>

          <a
            href="#"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[#5B9BD5] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:opacity-90 transition"
          >
            Learn How We’re Redefining Economic Development →
          </a>
        </div>
      </Card>
    </section>

  </section>
</PageLayout>
